; ============================================================================
; BSYS_OnDeathUDE
; ============================================================================
; xNVSE OnDeath, registered per Benny ref in InitLoadUDF - on ended saves
; too. While the spree runs any Benny death ends it (EndCheckUDF). Either
; way the body then gets its ledger and payout HERE, by explicit ref: the
; dispatch sits at the dying->dead transition, past the ~2s fall that
; on-dying loot sweeps (Sweet Scarcity) run inside, and the spree may
; have ended with Benny alive long before (he fled the Tops - issue
; #7). No-op if EndCheck already served him.
; ============================================================================

Create: BSYS_OnDeathUDE

ref rKilled
ref rKiller

Begin Function { rKilled, rKiller }
  if Player.AuxVarGetFlt "_BSYS_iEnded" == 0
    Call BSYS_EndCheckUDF
  endif

  ; Still 0 = the end was deferred (safe view open) - the deferred
  ; settle serves him, or the next load's self-heal does
  if Player.AuxVarGetFlt "_BSYS_iEnded"
    Call BSYS_BookSpawnUDF rKilled
  endif
End
